    "title": "fix: handle unhandled edge cases in configuration parser",
    "body": "## Summary\r\n\r\nThis PR improves the configuration parser by handling empty configuration files and missing required fields more gracefully through the use of safe fallback defaults.\r\n\r\n### Changes\r\n\r\n* Implemented fallback defaults for missing configuration fields.\r\n* Improved parser behavior for empty configuration files.\r\n* Prevented unexpected failures when optional values are absent.\r\n* Added unit tests covering empty configuration scenarios and missing fields.\r\n\r\n### Validation\r\n\r\n* Ran the full test suite.\r\n* Verified new edge-case tests pass successfully.\r\n* Confirmed the project builds successfully and passes all checks.\r\n\r\nCloses #221\r\n\r\n## Summary\r\n\r\nThis PR enhances the documentation for the core module by adding comprehensive docstrings to public trait implementations and their associated methods.\r\n\r\n### Changes\r\n\r\n* Added documentation to all public traits.\r\n* Documented public trait methods with their expected behavior.\r\n* Improved module-level documentation for better discoverability.\r\n* Included examples where appropriate and ensured they compile successfully.\r\n\r\n### Validation\r\n\r\n* Reviewed documentation for completeness and consistency.\r\n* Verified documentation examples compile successfully.\r\n* Confirmed the project builds successfully and passes all checks.\r\n\r\nCloses #223\r\n",
